Error [jet.RunInLibrary]: A library package can't declare `run: fn`
  --> tests/ui/library_package_run/run.jet:5:1
    |
  5 | run: fn() {
    | ^^^
 Why: A package is one namespace: an executable package has one `run: fn`, or one in each entry file its `outputs` name, and a library package, which other code imports, has none.
 Fix: Move the program into its own package or a loose file that uses this library, or make this package an executable.
